Written fresh for learning. The Apple Passwords native-messaging protocol is
cross-checked against Apple's own extension and against prior work, from which
some parts are derived under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  Open Passwords
  https://github.com/ManiForoughi2/open-passwords
  Copyright 2026 the Open Passwords contributors

  icloud-passwords-firefox
  https://github.com/au2001/icloud-passwords-firefox
  Copyright (c) au2001

Derived vs original, by file:
  native/installer/   original. Its browser table (bundle IDs, data dirs)
                      follows the list in Open Passwords' native/install.sh.
  packages/core/src/  derived from Open Passwords' src/crypto.js, srp.js and
                      protocol.js, which port icloud-passwords-firefox.
  packages/core/test/ original; srp-vectors.json was generated by running
                      Open Passwords' srp.js.
  packages/classifier/src/
                      derived from Open Passwords' src/content.js.
  packages/classifier/test/fixtures/
                      copied from Open Passwords' test-harness/, except
                      adversarial/checkout-signin.html, which is original.
  packages/hme/       original code; its endpoint paths, request shapes and
                      Origin/Referer rewrite follow the extension below
                      (MIT License, reproduced at the end of this file).
  targets/chromium/   original.

Hide My Email endpoints and header rules are derived from:

